{"applicationId":"fd6a396e6d214afc8e72ed508724e213","applicationName":"中交路南-出差考勤管理","content":"(function () {\r\n     var applicationId = $.context.getCurrentApplicationId();\r\n\tvar list=$.contact.queryAllUser();\r\n        for(var i=0;i<list.size();i++){\r\n            var user=list.get(i);\r\n            var adddoc=$.form.createEmptyDocument(applicationId,\"员工信息维护\");\r\n            adddoc.addElement(\"姓名\",user.getId())\r\n            adddoc.addElement(\"员工\",user.getName())\r\n            adddoc.addElement(\"账号\",user.getAccount())\r\n            $.form.saveFormDocument(adddoc,applicationId)\r\n\r\n        }\r\n})()","createTime":1765854149000,"createUserId":"1889706623013949441","customJsId":"","definitionId":"","hiddenCode":"b3e8fa3587d44889a43daaa80e5804f3","id":"ae7446564704438187414c5beb99cc92","modelCode":"","modelId":"d37b5bf2704b4b3996edbbfdfbeaee74","modelType":"PC_BUSINESS_DESIGN","namespace":"111","path":"员工信息维护","status":"NORMAL","tenantId":"9134167922923ba09ad18872b2b1246e","updateTime":1765854149000,"versions":0.0}